<title>HONG KONG: Playmates Toys 1996 net returns to gain.</title>
<headline>Playmates Toys 1996 net returns to gain.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   8.1 gain     vs 14.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.0	    vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	    vs 76.66 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    53.64 profit vs 97.60 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,218.51     vs 1,118.95</p>
<p>    Company name		 Playmates Toys Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 26-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 6</p>
<p>NOTE - Playmates Toys is a toy developer, marketer and distributor.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nine H.K. cents (including interim dividend of three cents) vs 8.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
